### Add Car True
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Aventador",
  "manufacturingDate": "2025-10-11",
  "owned": true
}


### Add Car False
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Huracan",
  "manufacturingDate": "2024-10-11",
  "owned": false
}


### Delete Car
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cars/25


### Update Car
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "model": "Aventador",
  "manufacturingDate": "2025-10-11",
  "owned": true
}


### Get All Cars
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars



